        "A. 36.",
        "B. −36.",
        "C. 35.",
        "D. 34."
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "note": "Đáp án đúng là: B Ta có: \\(\\frac{{x + 1}}{{35}} + \\frac{{x + 3}}{{33}} \\ge \\frac{{x + 5}}{{31}} + \\frac{{x + 7}}{{29}}\\) Suy ra \\(\\frac{{x + 1}}{{35}} + 1 + \\frac{{x + 3}}{{33}} + 1 \\ge \\frac{{x + 5}}{{31}} + 1 + \\frac{{x + 7}}{{29}} + 1\\) \\(\\frac{{x + 36}}{{35}} + \\frac{{x + 36}}{{33}} \\ge \\frac{{x + 36}}{{31}} + \\frac{{x + 36}}{{29}}\\) \\(\\frac{{x + 36}}{{35}} + \\frac{{x + 36}}{{33}} - \\frac{{x + 36}}{{31}} - \\frac{{x + 36}}{{29}} \\ge 0\\) (x + 36) \\(\\left( {\\frac{1}{{35}} + \\frac{1}{{33}} - \\frac{1}{{31}} - \\frac{1}{{29}}} \\right)\\) ≥ 0. Nhận thấy \\(\\frac{1}{{35}} + \\frac{1}{{33}} - \\frac{1}{{31}} - \\frac{1}{{29}}\\) < 0. Nên x + 36 ≤ 0 hay x ≤ −36. Suy ra nghiệm của bất phương trình là x ≤ −36. Vậy a = −36."
